```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client1 as Client 1 (Alice)
    participant WS as WebSocket Server
    participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub
    participant Client2 as Client 2 (Bob)

    Note over Client1,Client2: Connection Phase
    Client1->>WS: WebSocket connect (/ws/session-123?user_id=alice)
    WS->>Redis: SADD session:123:users alice
    WS->>Redis: SETEX session:123:user:alice 30 {metadata}
    WS->>Redis: SUBSCRIBE session:123
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH session:123 {event: "presence_joined", user: "alice"}
    WS-->>Client1: {event: "session_state", data: {...}}

    Client2->>WS: WebSocket connect (/ws/session-123?user_id=bob)
    WS->>Redis: SADD session:123:users bob
    WS->>Redis: SUBSCRIBE session:123
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH session:123 {event: "presence_joined", user: "bob"}
    Redis-->>WS: {event: "presence_joined", user: "bob"}
    WS-->>Client1: {event: "presence_joined", user: "bob"}
    WS-->>Client2: {event: "session_state", data: {...}}

    Note over Client1,Client2: Heartbeat Phase (every 10s)
    loop Every 10 seconds
        Client1->>WS: {type: "heartbeat", timestamp: "..."}
        WS->>Redis: EXPIRE session:123:user:alice 30
        Client2->>WS: {type: "heartbeat", timestamp: "..."}
        WS->>Redis: EXPIRE session:123:user:bob 30
    end

    Note over Client1,Client2: Action Broadcasting
    Client1->>WS: {type: "action", action_type: "vote_cast", target_id: "option-1", data: {value: "strong"}}
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH session:123 {event: "collaboration_action", user: "alice", action: {...}}
    WS->>Redis: LPUSH session:123:actions {...} (persist=true)
    Redis-->>WS: Broadcast to all subscribers
    WS-->>Client1: {event: "collaboration_action", ...}
    WS-->>Client2: {event: "collaboration_action", ...}

    Note over Client1,Client2: Disconnection Phase
    Client1->>WS: WebSocket disconnect
    WS->>Redis: SREM session:123:users alice
    WS->>Redis: DEL session:123:user:alice
    WS->>Redis: PUBLISH session:123 {event: "presence_left", user: "alice"}
    Redis-->>WS: Broadcast disconnect
    WS-->>Client2: {event: "presence_left", user: "alice"}

    Note over Client1,Client2: Performance: <100ms broadcast latency (p95)
```

**Description**: WebSocket protocol flow showing presence tracking, Redis pub/sub messaging, heartbeat mechanism, and action broadcasting.
